# Deploy exactly what production needs: web/, api/, oryon_score/, vercel.json.
# Local development cruft must never enter the upload bundle — a stale
# .env.local in the bundle made the Lambda bootstrap fail with
# EnvFileReadError (FUNCTION_INVOCATION_FAILED) on 2026-07-17.
.git
.gitignore
.venv-test
.venv
venv
.env*
.pytest_cache
__pycache__
*.egg-info
tests
examples
.vercel
.DS_Store
*.log
LAUNCH_PLAYBOOK.md
SECURITY_REVIEW.md
CONTRIBUTING.md
